  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以根据表单id获取已有表单的信息详情，详情包括客户ID、实例ID、实例名称、表单标题等。需配合【获取Access-Token】接口获取授权access-token。\",\"id\":\"ad.tools_clue_form.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/clue/form/detail/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710622245903\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，需通过该接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求和应答的返回码及信息说明需参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710622245903\",\"title\":\"建站工具——查询表单详情\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-azN6rjtP\">通过此接口，用户可以根据表单id获取已有表单的信息详情。<span style=\"color: #eb1010;\"></span></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Plm9Vn5Q\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7lVeM6sA\">详情包括客户ID、实例ID、实例名称、表单标题、提交按钮文案、副标题、表单元素、元素标签、是否允许为空、表单元素类型、是否可重复等信息。</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201773917102647296%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-AmezT8F4\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ouVy4Nj\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/clue/form/detail/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/clue/form/detail/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710622245903\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-X36mLTFZ\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-hpK92UwQ\">GET</p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-kdR9iopo\" id=\"lin